3. Zone inside the corner:
   - Inside this larger corner area, define a smaller zone (e.g., Zone1).
   - The system should specifically detect entry/exit events within this zone.
   - Only when an object enters this zone, trigger a specific action (like displaying a message or logging an event).

Additional details:
- The sensor sends raw data (character stream) which needs to be decoded.
- The implementation should be in JavaScript (ES5 compatible).
- Commands are sent via serial communication.

Provide:
- Sample code to set FOICORNER coordinates
- Code to define a zone inside the corner
- Logic to detect when an object enters the zone
- Example of parsing incoming sensor data and triggering UI action
